<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-21T02:42:19.983Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 02:42:19 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sinaloa cartel is now targeting U.S. rail companies, while a federal grand jury indicted 21 individuals with alleged ties to the La Nueva Familia Michoacana cartel across Texas and Mexico. A report says the $3.3 billion U.S.-Mexico counternarcotics aid program has not reduced violence, and the Laredo port was cited in the same investigation. A federal officer shot a man in Houston who was not an ICE target, according to DHS. Mexican leader Sheinbaum’s 21‑hour economy-class flight drew praise in China, and El Chapo allegedly bribed a former Mexican president with $100 million. There were 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/live/2026/11/18/world/trump-xi-putin-apec/claudia-sheinbaum-mexico-flight-china-apec&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxNTE1ONXhHUWdLZWxnUml3dVlsamlUZnBiV2FldGlIcXlTd3oxa0RfcFdXMzMtWTFFNFBWR0FsQjZHVDNPY21JZGh6R0RmQkFTTGRKRjA3WVlubkpQZk14YTd5eEtPajE2aU9vMmUzQngtQmt3RGx5Y1JVRXJpUm1TRUZib1h6VFU1d2JlejI0MloyazMtZk5wdHpxZURYTlF3eERfdWxLQVJtQVBWRFppTEp3YUhVLTdxWXd0X1NuV0ZtdGxCTjhiNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;kens5.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxPMjFPTzVWRmJNU2ZqRWhJYTE0YmctTEhYVXhjXzFpX3ZKb1RwRVJQUk0zWXhkQmstbGlQNnhESF96YVhscWx6N0RZSHZRRXhaVnNxTVV4YjZ6VVJXZ0N0X2ZDeHNlaFJiTjlURnluYlNuQkxaLUZiUGpiSXpKMDk4SEFLeHVldzlKa3NSSFB0c056UnpzczB6R2xqeUxwd01KbHJzenptcGItSzM1U2JaS0VkZ1dDQjBKc3RzMm80aDU1bUtRck5rXzR5SFM0Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Texas Public Radio | TPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5&quot;&gt;KVUE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a hre